00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:49.760
a security administrator tool for analyzing networks. And kind of like the name sounds,

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:54.640
it was a tool that you could point at points on the network, machines on the network, anywhere in

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:58.540
